{"ID":"20240205153844-uc5b0zb","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153844-uc5b0zb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153844-uc5b0zb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100722-p541npi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607124720-22t8ltm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619141521-sjmu21e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:6,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:6\u0026#125;","title":"067决明子（草决明）","type":"doc","updated":"20240807143206"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206100722-p541npi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100722-p541npi","updated":"20240206100730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产安徽、江苏、四川等地。\n【性状】\t该品略呈四方形或短圆柱形，两端近平行，稍倾斜，长37mm，宽24mm，绿棕色或暗棕色，平滑有光泽，背腹面各有1条突起的棱线，棱线两侧各有1条淡黄色的线形凹纹；质坚硬，不易破碎。横切面可见薄的种皮和2片3形折曲的黄色子叶。气微，味微苦。\n【性味】\t甘、苦、咸，微寒。\n【功效】\t清热明目，润肠通便。用于目赤涩痛，羞明多泪，头痛眩晕，目暗不明，大便秘结。归肝、肾、大肠经。有减肥之功效。治风热赤眼，青盲，雀目，高血压，肝炎，肝硬化腹水，习惯性便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240206100723-2xbzrpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100723-2xbzrpr","updated":"20240206100723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206100723-bcyc15s.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155716-h8ichu2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155716-h8ichu2","updated":"20240220175603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"决明子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/决明子-20240205155716-htp4ov4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619140647-rfrrh5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619140647-rfrrh5g","updated":"20240807132315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 455px;","style":"width: 445px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"决明子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/决明子-20240619140647-n701s55.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 445px;\" parent-style=\"width: 455px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240807132609-k3u10rq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807132609-k3u10rq","updated":"20240807134954"}},{"ID":"20240807142523-m5nl9f3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807142523-m5nl9f3","updated":"20240807142735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 311px;","style":"width: 301px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"决明子 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/决明子 6-20240807142523-detij90.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 301px;\" parent-style=\"width: 311px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 310px;","style":"width: 300px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"决明子 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/决明子 7-20240807142644-zoer997.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 300px;\" parent-style=\"width: 310px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span",